    <h1>Directions to Comstar International for Truck Drivers</h1>
    <div class="truckinternation">
        <ul>
            <li>Comstar International</li>
            <li>20-47 128th Street</li>
            <li>College Point, NY 11356</li>
            <li>Fax: 718-353-5998</li>
            <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+1718445-7900">(718) 445-7900</a></li>
            <li>Phone: <a href="tel:+1718445-7900">1-800-328-0142</a></li>
        </ul>
        <p>Below are suggested routes for truck drivers to help avoid small streets and hairpin turns.</p>
