    <div class="viewonmap">
        <h2>FROM MANHATTAN</h2>
        <div class="viewonmapbx">
            <div class="viewgoolemaplink">
                <a href="https://www.google.com/maps/dir/40.8122251,-73.935847/Comstar+International+Inc,+2045+128th+Street,+Flushing,+NY+11356/@40.7955443,-73.8623774,13z/data=!4m24!4m23!1m15!3m4!1m2!1d-73.8591259!2d40.8260788!3s0x89c2f4c4d65469f3:0xff4f11379d146c7e!3m4!1m2!1d-73.8388519!2d40.7788187!3s0x89c28aac6062310b:0xaebebd51f22334ca!3m4!1m2!1d-73.8407611!2d40.7765242!3s0x89c28aaae0fb44df:0xb3e5ebf9abe788e0!1m5!1m1!1s0x89c28aac934ba43f:0xdc89bf0c3d96e2c1!2m2!1d-73.840123!2d40.78037!3e0?hl=en-US">View on Google Map</a>
            </div>
            <ul>
                <li>Get on <strong>I-87 S</strong> in Bronx from Madison Ave</li>
                <li>Take <strong>I-278 E</strong>, continue</li>
                <li>Take <strong>I-678</strong> S to <strong>Whitestone Expressway</strong></li>
                <li>Take <strong>Whitestone exit</strong></li>
                <li>Take <strong>Exit 15</strong> (20th Ave)</li>
                <li>Turn <strong>Right</strong> onto <strong>20th Avenue</strong></li>
                <li>Turn <strong>Left</strong> onto <strong>130th Street</strong></li>
                <li>Go <strong>South</strong> approximately 2 blocks</li>
                <li>Turn <strong>Right</strong> onto <strong>25th Avenue</strong></li>
                <li>Turn <strong>Right</strong> at <strong>128th Street</strong></li>
                <li>Drive <strong>2 blocks</strong> to <strong>22nd Avenue</strong></li>
               
            </ul>
            <p>The building is on the right, at the corner 22nd Avenue and 128th Street. Pull up to the bay doors</p>
        </div>
